  "details": "Also see https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/bug-1351-ik-and-animations-break-in-mirror-when-switching-from-non-rigged-avatar for another related bug.\n\nI also found out that if you change out of a non-rigged avatar, or non-humanoid rigged avatar, the avatar will still stay rendered for the local user, but not display in the mirror. It's also possible for several avatars to 'stack' until leaving the instance.\n\nVideo embed link: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1159646835858735204\n\nVideo file: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1159646835447705660/2023-10-05_19-08-45.mp4?ex=6531c846&is=651f5346&hm=1893352c291055c632b0ca2605b8b011565374d772352a3a7046853ff67319f9&",
